h the Crow Museum","subtitle":"Sunday midday · UT Dallas campus","notes":"Choose a few works rather than rushing the galleries, then compare notes with a friend outside. Check holiday closures before making the walk over.","short_summary":"A campus art museum with free daily admission.","evidence_claim":"The Crow Museum’s UT Dallas location lists daily admission as free and regular hours Tuesday–Sunday, 11 a.m.–5 p.m.","source_url":"https://crowmuseum.org/about-the-museum/faqs/","source_title":"Frequently Answered Questions | Crow Museum of Asian Art","source_kind":"cultural_institution","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Regular hours are Tuesday–Sunday, 11 a.m.–5 p.m.; closed Mondays and specified holidays. Some exhibitions or photography areas may have restrictions.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"cometville","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"Cometville","title":"Save Cometville for your first involvement fair","subtitle":"Weeks of Welcome · SU Mall and Chess Plaza","notes":"When Cometville is scheduled, bring one or two interests to explore and speak with a few groups. Take contact details, then decide on follow-ups later.","short_summary":"A Weeks of Welcome organization fair for campus resources and student groups.","evidence_claim":"UT Dallas describes Cometville as a Weeks of Welcome showcase of student organizations and departments; a Comet Calendar listing places it across the SU Mall and Chess Plaza.","source_url":"https://soc.utdallas.edu/events/","source_title":"Events | Student Organization Center","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"This is a recurring Weeks of Welcome event rather than a daily attraction; consult the Comet Calendar for the current date, location and accessibility details.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"utd-home-athletics","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"UT Dallas Home Athletic Event","title":"Cheer at a home Comets game","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon or a future weekend · athletics venues","notes":"Check the athletics schedule, choose a regular-season home game, and bring your Comet Card. Make it a relaxed way to learn campus chants and meet people.","short_summary":"Regular-season UT Dallas athletics are free to enrolled students with a Comet Card.","evidence_claim":"UT Dallas Athletics states that UT Dallas students receive free admission to home athletic events by presenting a valid Comet Card.","source_url":"https://utdcomets.com/sports/2022/8/17/utd-athletic-tickets","source_title":"UTD Athletic Tickets | University of Texas at Dallas Athletics","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2022-08-17","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Free student admission requires a valid Comet Card and does not necessarily apply to postseason or some special events; check the current schedule first.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":[]}],"warnings":[]}
